<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-11-07T08:59:25.907Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:59:25 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist groups in Cabo Delgado have killed a woman and a blogger exposing chromium pollution while livestreaming, and they released captured fishermen after a hostage situation. The violence has forced over 7,000 people to flee their homes and displaced more than 1,200 civilians, while insurgents have carried out more than 150 attacks in the past five months. Qatar and Mozambique held political consultations, and Russia noted updated bilateral relations with Mozambique. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTFB1eG5hNUJNNzFqUzRrejBSeWhUQUFQaUFQejZPVUFiakRuZklDdHQwNHJsdFZqeFh0N01RWGFZNGNIUDE2Z2c4RnljdHdqVmJtRGRBOHRHZWp0Y3paR3d0MQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPOEJvNEdTUlRZMXRIRmRaS19YVl9YMk5IdFN0Sm9OYmdJV3ZNemVfdm9OYzIyNWo3WWlzb3l0UmpVbEU1MHowVnJ2MmxsaXl3TktoY1lLeXVSRzNtLW9TYjJGTGlrVWNtQXhSM2NsanhEQTl2SG9CNkNONHNoUjlzc2NnWXd4YWJRSnI0amozWXBHa1NsQUNOenkyQXFGRlJHVWxYaVpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOc1ZBZDJjVzlNOHlmQ3ZjUGlCaUZ1Qm02SFlYeWlXVFVZYWlwOGhyVFhYNjNucTUyY012Q284QzZhaWZ0YnRUVXM0VmEwNlBxb0JQbTNuY0RPY1pScVFiNFFJdUdsYUYzNkJBNjVRQmtCOVRoX0lQcjNpdE1UV1FzRUhZYWdOTmFwYi05MGVCcndDRjdyQ052dHFWa3Z4NW9Xa3c2MEVGeVRVbUU2YmhqUUtqanMtVHV5T054Zl93?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://n